    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this detached 3-Bedroom residence on 0.79 acres of land with stunning views of Lough Allen. \r\n\r\nNestled in a peaceful rural setting in North Leitrim, this residence enjoys an idyllic location with uninterrupted views over Lough Allen and the surrounding countryside. Situated on a generous site of approximately 0.79 acres, the property is located just 3 km from Dowra and approximately 17 km from Drumshanbo, offering the perfect balance of rural tranquillity and accessibility to local amenities and services. Extending to approximately 64.5 sq. m, the accommodation comprises of an entrance hallway, living room, kitchenette, bathroom, and No.3 bedrooms.\r\n\r\nWhile the property requires refurbishment and modernisation throughout, it presents an excellent opportunity for owner-occupiers, investors, or those seeking a countryside retreat to create a home to their own specification. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate this exceptional property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway\r\nLiving room\r\nKitchenette\r\nBathroom\r\nNo.3 bedrooms."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Detached residence extending to approx. 64.5 sq. m.\r\nSite area of approx. 0.79 acres\r\nSpectacular uninterrupted views of Lough Allen\r\nQuiet and scenic rural location\r\nOil-fired central heating\r\nGroup water scheme connection\r\nConveniently located 3 km from Dowra and 17 km from Drumshanbo\r\nExcellent renovation and redevelopment potential\r\nYear Built 1976"
      },
